# Uleguerand - Dominion Op #08 (abyssea 108, op 581): a level 99 Warrior in Abyssea - Uleguerand; the op's target
# Adasaurus (22 placed spawns, the first 17813692). The next op (#09, Ectozoon) and Altepa's and Grauberg's #08 accepted
# (a GM), this op available: an Adasaurus killed: no section: nothing. This op accepted (a GM; activeDominionOp stays 0,
# which dominionOnMobDeath does not read): an Adasaurus killed: dominionOnMobDeath(581): Quest[8][108]Prog 1
# (FOV_DEFEATED_TARGET 1 of 5). The next op's Ectozoon killed: Quest[8][109]Prog 1 (its own count), this op's unchanged.
# Prog 4 (a GM): one more: Prog 5 (5 of 5); another: the count is full (numDefeated < 5 is false): nothing. Completed
# (Prog 0, as completeDominionOp leaves it; a GM): another killed: no section: nothing. Abyssea - Uleguerand's IDs.lua
# names no mob, so each kill names its mob by id (kill #<id>). Perfect Dodge, Invincible and Elemental Sforzo (GM
# effects) keep the chars alive through the kills (the Abyssea mobs aggro and link).
lists AbysseaUleguerand/Adasaurus/onMobDeath AbysseaUleguerand/Ectozoon/onMobDeath
char zone=AbysseaUleguerand pos=-240,-40,-520 job=WAR lvl=99
login
effect 49                               # a GM: Perfect Dodge (melee hits evaded)
effect 50                               # a GM: Invincible (no physical damage)
effect 522                              # a GM: Elemental Sforzo (no magic damage)
quest Abyssea.DominionOp09Uleguerand accepted # a GM: the next op
quest Abyssea.DominionOp08Altepa accepted # a GM: Altepa's #08
quest Abyssea.DominionOp08Grauberg accepted # a GM: Grauberg's #08
kill #17813692                          # available: nothing
quest Abyssea.DominionOp08Uleguerand accepted # a GM
kill #17813693                          # accepted: Prog 1
kill #17813630                          # Ectozoon: Quest[8][109]Prog 1
charvar Quest[8][108]Prog 4             # a GM
kill #17813694                          # Prog 5
kill #17813695                          # full: nothing
quest Abyssea.DominionOp08Uleguerand completed # a GM
charvar Quest[8][108]Prog 0             # a GM
kill #17813696                          # completed: nothing
